flowchart LR
  classDef front fill:#E4EDEE,stroke:#0E5A6B,color:#1C2024,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef service fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#D9D5CB,color:#1C2024;
  classDef risk fill:#FDEBE8,stroke:#B3261E,color:#4A0E0A;
  classDef rule fill:#E7F3EA,stroke:#2F7D4A,color:#0F2E17;
  classDef data fill:#FFF3D1,stroke:#A86B00,color:#3D2600;
  subgraph desk[Service centre]
    C[Citizen] --> O[Operator]
    O --> UI[React TS frontend: Upload / Review / Bengali Print]
  end
  subgraph edge[API / security]
    API[HTTPS API: auth, CORS, limits] --> Consent[Consent + case record]
    Consent --> Ingest[Validation + secure upload]
  end
  subgraph intel[Document intelligence + verified rules]
    OCR[OCR / Gemini extraction] --> N[Normalize + provenance]
    N --> Audit[Mismatch audit: suggestions labelled as inferences]
    Audit --> R[Versioned deterministic scheme rules]
    R --> SUM[Bengali template renderer]
  end
  subgraph data[Protected data services]
    Store[(Encrypted temporary object store)]
    DB[(Case + consent audit database)]
    Packs[(Officially sourced rule packs)]
    TTL[Retention + deletion]
  end
  UI -->|POST /api/v1/cases/check| API
  Ingest --> OCR
  Ingest -.-> Store
  Consent -.-> DB
  Packs -.-> R
  Store --> TTL
  SUM -->|CheckResult; human approves| UI
  UI -.->|Manual operator submission only| Portal[Official government portals]
  class UI,O,API front;
  class Consent,Ingest,OCR,N,SUM,Portal service;
  class Audit risk;
  class R rule;
  class Store,DB,Packs,TTL data;
